{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/a6sAjP83mob1rXgxyMHaTg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:18.258120+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/a6sAjP83mob1rXgxyMHaTg","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/OOgCgEfby1J0gHXzg4mVtP3UK2JVv32glVaCRztdXkVFk8zcTzf0GLwnfgxoiaBwZUiaCqvK3lrK66N29SeJGHvHfDNFHthPUib0E1RTFYfxbs/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>复旦大学智能医学研究院2027年度拟招全日制学术学位推荐免试硕士研究生和学术学位直博生。</span></p><p><span>复旦大学智能医学研究院主页：</span></p><p><span>https://imi.fudan.edu.cn/</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、报名时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>即日起至8月10日17:00</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>二、报名条件</span></strong></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.全国各高等学校2027年应届本科毕业生。</span></p><p><span>2.学习成绩优秀，预期可获得推荐免试资格。</span></p><p><span>3.具有较强的学术创新或实践应用能力。有志于从事学术研究工作，有较强的或潜在的研究能力，学风端正，品德良好。</span></p><p><span>4.欢迎智能医学、计算机、数学、统计学等交叉学科相关专业的优秀大学生踊跃报名参加。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>三、报名材料</span></strong></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.近期正面免冠彩色证件照片，电子版JPG格式，150×200像素，大小500K以内。</span></p><p><span>2.本科阶段现有完整成绩单（须加盖学校教务处或院系公章），JPG或PDF格式。</span></p><p><span>3.外语水平证明，如CET-4、CET-6、雅思、托福、专业外语成绩等。</span></p><p><span>4.有关获奖证书和学术科研成果，如发表论文、出版物或其他原创性工作。</span></p><p><span>5.诚信承诺书（可从报考服务系统下载，签名后上传）。</span></p><p><span>6.个人简历一份和个人陈述一份（均为A4单面一页）。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、报名方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>申请人登录复旦大学研究生招生网（https://gsao.fudan.edu.cn）,通过“研究生报考服务系统”中的“推免生报名”进行网上报名。</span><strong><span>本院挂靠复旦大学生物医学研究院（院系代码：151）的医学系统生物学（专业代码：1001Z3）下的智能医学方向招生。</span></strong></p><p><span>本系无须寄送纸质材料。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、其他说明</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.申请人应承诺填报信息和提交材料的真实性。如有弄虚作假，一经发现将取消申请资格并通报其本科院校。</span></p><p><span>2. 申请人在录取当年入学报到前必须取得国家承认的本科毕业证书和学位证书，否则录取资格无效。</span></p><p><span>3. 凡有意报考我单位2027级推免研究生的同学（含本校本科生），应申请参加本次选拔活动。如果上级部门和学校关于推免生招生选拔活动有新要求，我单位将按新要求执行并及时通知申请人。</span></p><p><span>4.暑期咨询方式：张老师，电子邮箱：zhui@fudan.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>本《工作通知》自公布之日起实施，未列事项参照学校相关规定执行，由复旦大学智能医学研究院负责解释。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mib0gSYX5LfsoRCcVGcSUOtnHz8gKOMI30gqfEMjAQia1HNNk6ej9QqXV3XfgsdXaKYyATFfOLqb0Ap1CrlY6ibYQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/OOgCgEfby1JY5iawibFQGAUTGPXLXNiatwia1EdyXxrkUAEGolfZhhR79ZyAaWLKXV0EnSLXaiaT1h7iaDRnkL5VFoSyib2CpDJIbsQrAibjMubptRs/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"d830471cac4a446ced991d014f5e16aede941c8a8273693ebcd7d5840b2af838","textLength":874,"sourceSha256":"5dd55412eb06533238926d8538b144192c0f539008bc71629c7006398271b6ea","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2453f7a9ba48a5fef2c3","title":"2026年复旦大学智能医学研究院2027级推免生招生报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:18.258120+00:00"}
